comment;#1: District projects cover the construction, modernization, or renovation of neighborhood infrastructure. They are split into neighborhood files because the official rule applies a separate neighborhood budget cap: 300,000 PLN for neighborhoods with up to 2,000 registered residents and 400,000 PLN for neighborhoods above 2,000 registered residents.
